[shake rate=20 level=10]Your heart pounds as your entire body begins to shake.[/shake]

 The beast lunges toward the glowing being, trying to seize it. The creature narrowly escapes and flies straight toward you.

???: Run!!!

The two of you sprint back toward the road. You rush inside your house in a panic, only to realize the glowing being has followed you.
do SceneController.hide_character("Sprite3")
do SceneController.fade_to_black()
do SceneController.change_background("res://Visual Novel Romance/files/fundo-branco-png.png")

{{GameData.player_name}}: This has to be some kind of nightmare... Or maybe I'm losing my mind.

???: Thank you for giving me shelter, Dreamer.

{{GameData.player_name}}: ...

{{GameData.player_name}}: By the Goddess... WHAT WAS THAT?!

???: My name is Ello.

Ello: I am a guardian of dreams. My duty is to protect the dreams of every living soul.

Ello: I was watching over people's dreams, but little by little... there were fewer dreams left to protect.

Ello: So I decided to come here, hoping I could help restore people's dreams. But unfortunately, the nightmares had the same idea.

Ello: The beasts born from nightmares have taken physical form.

{{GameData.player_name}}: Wait... You mean like the stories I used to hear when I was a kid?

Ello: I suppose so. Every culture has its own way of describing the beings who watch over dreams.

Ello: The beast chasing me wanted my powers. It won't stop until it devours every dream that's left.

Ello: I think we're safe here. Those creatures thrive in darkness. It's easier for them to twist what people see, filling the living with fear before tormenting them in their nightmares.

Ello: I'm worried about the animals still trapped in the forest...

{{GameData.player_name}}: [shake rate=10 level=5] What about my cat?! Is Felix in danger? What am I supposed to do?![/shake]

Ello: I don't think we should return to the forest. It's far too dangerous.

Ello: I can try to protect his dreams. If I succeed, he'll be safe for now

{{GameData.player_name}}: I don't know... What's the worst that beast could do?

Ello: ...

Ello: It could corrupt what remains of this world, driving everyone into madness through endless nightmares

Ello: I need to rest. Nearly being devoured isn't exactly easy to recover from

Ello settles down to rest in the living room

do SceneController.hide_character("Sprite5")
do SceneController.fade_to_black()
