~ tell 
do SceneController.show_character("Sprite1")
do SaveManager.set_checkpoint("tell")
{{GameData.player_name}}: You won't believe this... Felix ran away, and when I went looking for him, I ended up finding a dream guardian

{{GameData.player_name}}: This is crazy

Gio: What? Wait, that was a lot to take in all at once

Gio: I didn't expect the prophecy to have already begun... It was only speculation

Gio: This means we haven't been alone for some time

Gio becomes thoughtful, his expression growing somewhat serious

- Ask questions
  => ask

~ ask
do SceneController.show_character("Sprite1")
{{GameData.player_name}}: What does all of this mean?

Gio: So... this means that people in general no longer dream, but despite that, they are still susceptible to the influence of nightmares

Gio: Because of this, the guardians have lost a large part of their strength, which came from the vitality of human dreams

Gio: All of this is quite surprising... It's a process of metamorphosis

{{GameData.player_name}}: Huh??

Gio: How can I put this... It's a change expected in a possible future. It's not predetermined, but it does have certain tendencies

Gio: The prophecy indicates that the future has two main paths. In one, it is possible to restore people's dreams through the intervention of the guardians, while the other happens if the guardians' intervention fails

Gio: The guardians' intervention must be indirect and cautious, because they need to guide people toward understanding who they are, discovering and rediscovering their forgotten dreams

Gio: From there, they will begin to dream more often and in a healthier way, because they will understand that what lies hidden within them can only be safely controlled by understanding who they are, meaning the nightmares' attacks will no longer have any effect

{{GameData.player_name}}: ...And what if they fail?

Gio: It is very likely that people will begin to experience nightmares so real and intense that they will start confusing reality with their nightmares

Gio: They will become aggressive and unrecognizable, because they will see nothing but distortions

Gio: We can continue this later, we should get to class

You go to your classroom and remain thoughtful about the new information you have learned. You pay attention during the university classes from time to time

You wonder if you will meet Gio after class

After hours of studying, you find yourself ready to leave

