{{GameData.player_name}}: Any news?

Ello: I think so. I'm making progress regarding people's dreams. It's not a milestone, but it's a beginning

Ello: I can't find your cat, but he seems to be making friends in the forest

Ello: In fact, I found some individuals who were already in a serious stage of disturbance. Helping animals in that condition is no longer so simple

