{{GameData.player_name}}: Sister, how do I know if my dream is a good one?

Sister: When it brings you peace and fulfillment, you'll know you're on the right path.

{{GameData.player_name}}: What if I want to be so many things? Can I become anything I want?

Sister: You might have a passion for many things, but try to focus on one at a time—otherwise, you might end up lost.

Sister: Life is about making choices on what truly matters. Sometimes we have to hold onto certain things and let others go.

{{GameData.player_name}}: So, Sister... what dream did you choose?

Sister: To build a happy family. Growing up wasn't easy for us, so nothing mattered more to me than creating a place we could truly call home.

Sister: And now that dream is coming true—I have all of you, my family, right here with me.

{{GameData.player_name}}: And what do you do once your dream comes true?

Sister: Now? Now I get to help the rest of my family achieve theirs.

